[
    {
        "text": "\u7b2c\u4e8c\u5173\uff08\u540e\uff09",
        "tag": "header",
        "key": "title_test",
        "is_skippable": true,
        "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_corridor",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$m_dia_street_intro",
        "key": "$m_dia_street_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh... Rosmontis, what are you doing?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I wanna fix this terminal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Six years of memories up to last year... I saved them all in here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "This morning, I went to read the log from June 12, but the screen wouldn't turn on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "What if... what if I can't ever read them again...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "The March 14th log, when I went to the botanical gardens with daddy, or hiking in July, or the time when mommy...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Mommy...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "D- don't cry! Listen, you're not great with screens, right?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why not wait until Scout can help you fix it? Or Closure?"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll take it to Closure for you. She'll fix it up lickety-split!"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "Scout...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is Scout that one operator who moves around all quiet?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's him! You know him?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "With that perfectly polished look... like a porcelain doll.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "There he is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh...?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_026",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I had yet to hear your estimation of me. I now understand how weak it is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.4,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "When did you get here?!"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_026"
    },
    {
        "text": "You could say I have always been here. I am used to concealing myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "So Mr. Scout was here all along.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why didn't Blaze sense it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I wasn't paying attention. I just didn't notice!"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, if you were standing here all this time, why didn't you help her fix it?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_026"
    },
    {
        "text": "Forgive me. We are mere moments from undertaking a mission. I must focus my energy on calibrating my weaponry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "text": "You might ask Closure, or the good Mechanist to assist you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you about to go save Dr. {@nickname}?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh. You're going too."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's me we're talking about. If I didn't go, what kind of joke would Rhodes Island's elite operators be?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_026",
        "name2": "char_014_riope",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And what did Ascalon say?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_026",
        "name2": "char_014_riope",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The usual. She's not going. Always there with Kal'tsit, that one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_026",
        "name2": "char_014_riope",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Did it ever occur to you... That now is perhaps not the optimal time?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_026",
        "name2": "char_014_riope",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But it might be our last chance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "text": "Chernobog is probably going to turn back deep into Ursus to avoid that Catastrophe. And a rescue operation in the Ursus interior is going to be damn near impossible.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "I keep hearing you talk about it, but is this Dr. {@nickname} really worth all this?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope"
    },
    {
        "text": "Worth as much as Amiya and Kal'tsit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Have I met the Doctor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Not yet. But you will soon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Good. I want to know what the Doctor is like too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "I really, really want to.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You will, kitten.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "By the way, Ace, there's an uninfected girl named GreyThroat on your team."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm aware. She's been training in isolation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen, Blaze. I've been working with her for a few months now. She has trouble expressing herself, but she's not a bad person.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "She looked my teammate in the eye and asked, 'How hard could it be to be Infected?'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know. But it might have been a legitimate question to her. She might really be curious.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not my place to demand an operator turn her opinion on a dime. And GreyThroat has never once questioned orders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't care. I'm not going to stand by and let her insult my teammates, and I sure as hell won't let her disgrace the struggle of the Infected."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now's not the time. I can see the rage you're holding back. But really, not now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.4,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "She said it right in front of me!"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_026"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take a breath, Big Cat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have a task at hand yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I do."
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine. We'll deal with it when you get back."
    },
    {
        "text": "Since when is Ace more senior than me?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope"
    },
    {
        "text": "When you take that tone, I start to think maybe you're screwing around.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "name2": "avg_npc_026",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She may very well be mocking you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "When he goes two days without shaving, he'll definitely look way more senior."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042",
        "name2": "char_014_riope",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ace's beard is very manly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Hm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hahaha! I have to go move some stuff around. Got my own job to do, you know. Later."
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's get a drink when I'm done!"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_026"
    },
    {
        "text": "Try not to puke this time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "text": "Misery spent two hours scrubbing the floor. I wager he would vomit himself when faced with that task again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who knew you could hold your liquor so well!"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rosmontis, Mechanist will give you back your terminal in a bit."
    },
    {
        "text": "Be a good girl and wait patiently. But don't forget either!"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll definitely remember! Bye bye!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_026"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't burn yourself!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Relax. I can control my own Arts."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_building_3",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness02_intro",
        "key": "$darkness02_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 3,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "...How is it you went before me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ace, was some uninfected girl like GreyThroat really worth training?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "How much trust did we earn? And how much trust did we give?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "If the Doctor...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "What are you saying over there?!;......;If I don't believe in Rhodes Island...?",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm saying bad things about you. To your face.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "If there's a Doctor hanging around here, hurry up and come out already. You'll need some fancy Arts to hide behind that wall if you don't want me to find you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then I'll string you up on a lamppost as bait for Reunion. Don't worry! You won't die. A few bolts and a knife or two never hurt anyone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "....sigh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sigh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did Amiya send you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whatever. That's what she's best at. And what she's worst at...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "I keep trying to remind her, to get her thinking about how she's still just a kid... it always seems to have the opposite effect.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess she'll never be able to put down that grown up persona of hers as long as she's the leader of Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, if it wasn't Amiya who sent you, if you decided to come keep me company all by yourself, I'm not against the idea.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Hold me back? Haha! I could carry three of you on my back and I wouldn't even notice. One little Dr. {@nickname} can't hold me back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, look over there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_building_3",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go on! Get out of here! We don't want to fight!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph... we won't yield to the Infected!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're outnumbered! What's the point?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Duty!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't blame us for what happens! You see those monsters behind us? Just run already!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "What monsters?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_building_3",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "See that Reunion group cutting through the alleys? They're picking at Lungmen's vanguard units. They won't hold for long...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Give me a path.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "The usual, or...?",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#8"
    },
    {
        "text": "The fastest, of course!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't give me that look. It's not like I've never carried you before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here we go! Smash Reunion and save the Lungmenites!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    }
]